 large number of parameters perhaps numbering in the hundreds of billions, and the error function will be a highly nonlinear function of those parameters. The error function can no longer be minimized through a closed-form solution and instead must be minimized through iterative optimization techniques based on evaluation of the derivatives of the error function with respect to the parameters, all of which may require specialist computational hardware and incur substantial computational cost.


